text:
i've played enough tap-to-earn games to know how repetitive they can get. Agent Dojo and Fomopoly bring something different to the table.

@agentdojo you're the coach. Train AI fighters that learn, remember and evolve through battles.

@fomopoly_rh you're the player. Trade virtual land, generate $DEAL and stocks, and navigate market psychology.

one explores AI learning through competition, the other turns market behavior into gameplay.

two different vibes, both worth exploring on Rarelist. which one would you try first?
